:2743:handoff body, authority fact, lease fact, or DaoStream outcome vocabulary.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2830:### 7.11.1 Blocker-closure acceptance matrix\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2843:- Invariant: A resumer executes the instruction stream named by the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2887:  at one pc, a nonempty ready queue, a nonsafepoint pc, and a kept response\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2896:  and effect trace must agree in both directions. Static\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2897:  `:yin.safepoint/kinds`, stack effect, and lexical reads agree with the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2903:  `:yin.k/not-at-safepoint`; queued work gives `:yin.k/not-quiescent`.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2912:  stream. Reads resume at the kept position. Force retention loss and\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2918:  are lease-governed, and a resumer that arrives after reclaim observes\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2959:  the safepoint row before cross-host values are accepted. Phase 1\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2971:  partition, and crashes after the successor append, resumed report, and\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2975:  before publication; polling or direct resume of the exporting source\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2996:- Invariant: A resumer runs only when every reachable dependency is\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3007:  every requirement before restoring. The resumed task reads the carried\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3025:This block adds obligations; it changes no row above. The safepoint\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3058:   both; a composition requiring exclusive refuses it. Stage: D.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-co